---
import DocsLayout from '../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import Callout from '../components/Callout.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import CardGrid from '../components/CardGrid.astro';
import { architectureRedirects } from '../data/redirects';
import { url } from '../data/site';
---

<DocsLayout title="Architecture Overview" sectionLabel="Architecture" activeSlug="architecture">
  <section class="section">
    <h2>Architecture Overview</h2>
    <p>VibeCrew is a system of specialized agents, deterministic hooks, and bash scripts that work together to enforce quality, manage attention, and continuously improve your workflow. This section explains <em>how VibeCrew works under the hood</em>.</p>

    <Callout type="info" title="New to coding?">
      <p>You don't need to understand all of this to use VibeCrew &mdash; just type the slash commands and the system handles the rest. But if you're curious about what's happening behind the scenes, or want to troubleshoot an issue, these pages have the answers. Each section starts with a plain-English explanation before diving into technical details.</p>
    </Callout>
  </section>

  <hr>

  <section class="section">
    <span class="section-label">Deep Dives</span>
    <h2>Explore Architecture</h2>
    <p>The architecture documentation is organized into focused pages:</p>

    <CardGrid>
      <Card href={url('/arch-system.html')} icon="&#9632;" iconColor="purple" title="System Deep Dive">
        Plugin manifest, 14-agent architecture, skills system, hook enforcement, scripts reference, settings &amp; permissions, MCP server integration.
      </Card>

      <Card href={url('/arch-runtime.html')} icon="&#9881;" iconColor="green" title="Runtime Systems">
        Status bar, interrupt protocol, phase gate, Vibe Score &amp; Performance Coach, context compaction, handoff system, error recovery, cost guardrails.
      </Card>

      <Card href={url('/arch-reference.html')} icon="&#9776;" iconColor="blue" title="Commands &amp; State">
        Full slash commands reference tables, <code>.vibecrew/</code> state management, git strategy, and schema migration.
      </Card>

      <Card href={url('/arch-design.html')} icon="&#9650;" iconColor="amber" title="Design &amp; Operations">
        Design principles, VitePress documentation dashboard, cross-project telemetry, and troubleshooting.
      </Card>
    </CardGrid>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>

<!-- Hash redirects from the old monolithic page -->
<script define:vars={{ redirects: architectureRedirects }}>
  (function() {
    var hash = window.location.hash;
    if (hash && redirects[hash]) {
      window.location.replace(redirects[hash]);
    }
  })();
</script>
